---
// The "Agent prompt" tab of a CodeTabs group: a prompt a reader pastes into
// their coding agent to do what the code block beside it does. Author it as
// one ```text fenced block inside <AgentPrompt>, placed inside <CodeTabs>
// after the code. CodeTabs turns it into a tab with the shared copy button.
---

<div class="agent-prompt" data-agent-prompt><slot /></div>
